// space3d/debris_sparks: a hull breaking apart (a ship losing a module, a small craft
// destroyed, a heavy hit): spawn at the break, `.facing(-hit_direction)` throws most of it back
// toward the shooter, `.scale(hull / 40)`. Glowing chunks tumble out and cool from orange to
// dark hull plating, a spray of sparks and long-lived embers follow, with a short flash that
// lights the hull around it (a light flash). Untinted (hot metal).
